Claude Code hooks live in `~/.claude/settings.json` under a `hooks` key. They look like:

```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [{ "matcher": "", "command": "echo '{...}' >> /path/to/trace.jsonl" }],
    "PreCompact": [{ "matcher": "", "command": "..." }]
  }
}
```

